  "body": "Are you looking to retire by the beach, or downsize without compromise?\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to simplify your lifestyle or secure a savvy investment, this adorable and affordable one bedroom brick and tile unit is an opportunity that's hard to ignore.\r\n\r\nOffering the perfect blend of cosy comfort, convenience, and low maintenance living, this charming home is ideal for retirees wanting to enjoy life without the upkeep, or investors seeking a property in a consistently desirable coastal location.\r\n\r\nAdd your own personal touches over time, or simply move in and enjoy everything this wonderful location has to offer. With a simple, easy care design, you'll have more time to spend doing the things you love.\r\n\r\nLeave the car at home and embrace the Orewa lifestyle. Stroll just five minutes to the beach for your morning walk, or enjoy a leisurely flat walk to Orewa Village, where cafés, restaurants, shops, the library, medical centre and everyday amenities are all at your fingertips. With a bus stop conveniently located across the road, commuting to the city couldn't be easier.\r\n\r\nTucked away in a peaceful cul de sac and surrounded by established gardens, this lock up and leave home is also just moments from the beautiful Orewa Estuary and its scenic walking and cycling paths.\r\n\r\nAffordable properties in this location are becoming increasingly difficult to find. Whether you're retiring by the coast or investing in a sought after seaside community, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nViewing is easy, call us today or visit our next open home.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
